  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "Given equation: 162 ÷ 9 × 16 + 18 - 27 = 126\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 16 and 9\n\nGiven: 162 ÷ 9 × 16 + 18 - 27 = 126\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**162 ÷ 16**__ × 9 + 18 - 27 = 126\n\n⇒ __10.125____** × 9**__ + 18 - 27 = 126\n\n⇒ __91.125 + 18__ - 27 = 126\n\n⇒ __109.125 - 27__ = 126\n\n⇒ 82.125 ≠ 126\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) 9 and 18**\n\nGiven: 162 ÷ 9 × 16 + 18 - 27 = 126\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**162 ÷ 18**__ × 16 + 9 - 27 = 126\n\n⇒ __**9 × 16**__ + 9 - 27 = 126\n\n⇒ __144 ____+ 9__ - 27 = 126\n\n⇒ __153 -____ 27__ = 126\n\n**⇒ 126 = 126**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) 18 and 27\n\nGiven: 162 ÷ 9 × 16 + 18 - 27 = 126\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**162 ÷ 9**__ × 16 + 27 - 18 = 126\n\n⇒ __**18 × 16**__ + 27 - 18 = 126\n\n⇒ __288** + 27**__ - 18 = 126\n\n⇒ __315____ - 18__ = 126\n\n⇒ 297 ≠ 126\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 27 and 9\n\nGiven: 162 ÷ 9 × 16 + 18 - 27 = 126\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**162 ÷ 27**__ × 16 + 18 - 9 = 126\n\n⇒ __**6 × 16**__ + 18 - 9 = 126\n\n⇒ __**96 + 18**__ - 9 = 126\n\n⇒ __114** - 9**__ = 126\n\n⇒ 105 ≠ 126\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
